# LAMMPS NPT parity reference for Atomiverse NoseHooverNPT.
#
# State point — chosen so the LJ-argon system is MECHANICALLY STABLE
# (dP/dV < 0, bulk modulus of order GPa) and the NPT ensemble is
# well conditioned:
#
#   * 256 LJ atoms, FCC start at a = 5.3 Å  (V ~ 9.5e3 Å^3)
#   * T = 100 K, P = 2731 bar
#
# Earlier revisions of this benchmark targeted P = 0: at T = 100 K
# that sits BELOW the LJ liquid-vapour coexistence pressure, so the
# liquid evaporated and both LAMMPS and Atomiverse ran away. A probe
# of P(V) at T = 100 K showed the V ~ 1.1-1.2e4 Å^3 range is also
# anomalous (dP/dV > 0 — mechanically unstable, ill-conditioned for
# NPT). V <= 9.5e3 Å^3 is the first density that is genuinely stiff
# and stable; 2731 bar is the NVT-measured equilibrium pressure
# there.
#
# `fix npt` uses MTK Nose-Hoover chains (mtchain = mpchain = 3,
# drag = 0) — the scheme Atomiverse's NoseHooverNPT implements.

units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

lattice         fcc 5.3
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 39.948

pair_style      lj/cut 8.5
pair_coeff      1 1 0.010339 3.405

velocity        all create 100.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep        0.001                  # 1 fs

thermo_style    custom step temp press lx pe ke vol
thermo          5000

# NVT pre-equilibration — thermalise at fixed box.
fix             eq all nvt temp 100.0 100.0 0.1
run             20000
unfix           eq

# NPT equilibration — tau_T = 100 fs, tau_P = 1000 fs.
fix             np all npt temp 100.0 100.0 0.1 iso 2731.0 2731.0 1.0
run             30000

# NPT sampling — ensemble averages written to lammps_npt_avgs.txt.
reset_timestep  0
compute         ctemp all temp
compute         cke   all ke
compute         cpe   all pe
compute         cpress all pressure ctemp
variable        vol_v equal vol
variable        lx_v  equal lx

fix             avgs all ave/time 1 50000 50000 c_ctemp c_cke c_cpe c_cpress v_vol_v v_lx_v &
                file lammps_npt_avgs.txt mode scalar

run             50000

print "All done"
